        def_en: "The product of the first committed step of purine synthesis, made by glutamine-PRPP amidotransferase. Highly unstable, with a half-life of 30 seconds at pH 7.5, so it must be handed directly to the next enzyme — the section's main evidence that these enzymes work as a metabolon rather than as free-floating catalysts.",
        def_cn: "嘌呤合成第一个定向步骤的产物，由谷氨酰胺-PRPP 酰胺转移酶生成。**极不稳定，pH 7.5 下半衰期仅 30 秒**，因此必须直接交到下一个酶手上——这是本节论证「这些酶以 metabolon 形式工作、而非各自游离」的主要证据。"
